.TH "CSSKEYWORDVALUE.VALUE" "3JS" "August 4, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
CSSKeywordValue.value \- CSSKeywordValue: value property
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]Note:\f[R] This feature is available in Web Workers.
.PP
The \f[B]\f[CB]value\f[B]\f[R] property of the
\f[CR]CSSKeywordValue\f[R] interface represents the keyword as a string.
.SH VALUE
A string.
.SS Exceptions
.TP
\f[B]TypeError\f[R]
Thrown if the \f[CR]value\f[R] property is set to an empty
\f[CR]String\f[R].
.SH EXAMPLES
.SS Basic usage
The following example resets the CSS \f[CR]display\f[R] property to its
defaults.
.IP
.EX
\f[B]let\f[R] indicator = document.getElementById(\(dqindicator\(dq);
indicator.attributeStyleMap.set(\(dqdisplay\(dq, \f[B]new\f[R] CSSKeywordValue(\(dqinitial\(dq));
indicator.attributeStyleMap.get(\(dqdisplay\(dq).value; \f[I]// \(aqinitial\(aq\f[R]
.EE
